StrongSort.Net
==============

A clean-room C# / .NET implementation of the StrongSORT multi-object tracking
algorithm. It is an independent implementation written from the published
description of the algorithm; it does not incorporate source code from any
third-party implementation.

Algorithm reference:
  StrongSORT: Make DeepSORT Great Again
  Yunhao Du, Zhicheng Zhao, Yang Song, Yanyun Zhao, Fei Su, Tao Gong, Hongying Meng
  arXiv:2202.13514 — https://arxiv.org/abs/2202.13514
  (builds on DeepSORT: Wojke, Bewley, Paulus, arXiv:1703.07402)

The default hyperparameters exposed on StrongSortOptions follow the SoccerNet
game-state tracking baseline; the values from the original StrongSORT paper are
documented inline in the source.

